        "snippet": "This dataset is intended to give an approximation of recreational trails for planning use only. Trails depicted are subject to change or closure due to trail conditions, land use operations and loss of landowner consent. Trails designated for one activity may not be accessible for all activities. Trails and roads in this data layer may also be maintained for management access, not for recreational use. Not all areas are open to public access and users of this data are responsible for determining the safety of access sites and ensuring they are not committing trespass. Intended for planning use only.",
