        "description": "<p>Trails data compiled by NH Dept. of Safety-Division of Emergency Services and Communications, NH Office of Planning and Development and NH Fish and Game Department from multiple public information sources including online maps, spatial data, orthophotos, and field data collection with handheld GPS units. Positional accuracy will vary. Coverage and attributes should not be construed as complete. Trails depicted are subject to change or closure due to trail conditions, land use operations and loss of landowner consent. Trails and roads in this data layer may be maintained for management access, not for recreational use. Not all areas are open to public access and users of this data are responsible for determining the safety of access sites and ensuring they are not committing trespass. Intended for planning use only.</p>",
